{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34760","headline":"和皮日休悼鸖 一 · 李縠","name":"和皮日休悼鸖 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才子襟期本上清，陆云家鸖伴闲情。\n犹怜反顾五六里，何意忽归十二城。\n露滴谁闻高叶坠，月沈休藉半阶明。\n人闻华表堪留语，剩向秋风寄一声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李縠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}